ne found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:1-17, 55-69, 107-124, 189-212` — Preserve automatic attachment, explicit first-store consent, and best-effort mount boundaries. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py:1-20, 43-54` — Preserve configuration precedence and presence-only secret handling. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py:1-8, 59-109, 123-129, 162-167, 269-285, 321-445, 523-549` — Preserve current result/exit mappings, signing, and sidecar persistence. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/_common.py:1-26` — Preserve the distinction between CLI invalid-input errors and config defaulting. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_registry_checks.py:1-19, 32-47` — Preserve validation ownership and closed adapter/capability vocabularies. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_cli/_registry.py:1-17, 32-36, 415-448` — Preserve route authority, lazy resolution, aliases, and policy fields. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/